## Goal
- Build, fix, and ship the entire Learnify AI LMS platform — deployment fixes, feature completions, billing system, admin tools, and production readiness.

## Constraints & Preferences
- Must deploy cleanly on Vercel (Washington D.C. / iad1 region)
- No breaking changes to existing features
- GitHub repo: `https://github.com/Vishwajeetsrk/learnifyai`
- Working directory: `C:\Users\vishw\Music\Learnify AI`
- Billing OS 2.0 spec: no hardcoded values, everything DB-driven, admin-editable
- Must not break: auth, profiles, wallet, courses, certificates, AI tools, resume, ATS, mock interviews, career roadmaps, creator system, Cashfree integration
- Package manager: pnpm (Vercel uses pnpm@10.x, local is pnpm v11.5.0)

