### In Progress
- (none — all known type errors fixed)

### Blocked
- Build (`pnpm build`) times out after 3 minutes — likely needs larger resource allocation or reduced `chunkSizeWarningLimit`

## Key Decisions
- Removing `(as any)` casts exposed real type bugs: `description`/`due_date`/`updated_at` missing from invoices type, `user_id` missing from billing_refunds inserts, `amount_inr` missing from manual invoice creation — all fixed by adding to DB type definitions or code
- `as never` used for dynamic-record supabase calls (Record<string, unknown> → Update/Insert types) as cleanest pragmatic fix
- `framer-motion`, `lucide-react`, `react-markdown` now code-split into vendor chunks (constraint changed from v3.9.0)
- MediaLibrary data normalization: transform at query layer (`tags` null→[], `folder` null→"") instead of pushing null handling to every usage site
- Vendor chunks extended from 7→16 specific entries (motion, icons, radix, forms, dates, markdown, dnd, validation, docs, overlays) to shrink main `index.js` (4.97 MB)

## Next Steps
1. Investigate build timeout — larger Vercel plan or reduce manualChunks
2. Wire remaining settings i18n strings: character dialog (~80), billing (~20), notifications (8), security (~15), branding (~15), toasts (~20)
3. Add mobile audit fixes for remaining components (small touch targets in course cards, 1-column grid for challenge cards on mobile)
4. Handle remaining `(supabase as any)` casts in component files (non-lib)
5. Commit and push v3.9.5

## Critical Context
- `validator()` vs `inputValidator()`: functionally equivalent; `inputValidator()` was deprecated
- Build passes locally with harmless `use client` MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE warnings (suppressed in `vite.config.ts`)
- `chunkSizeWarningLimit: 500` in `vite.config.ts`
- Email system uses 4-tier provider fallback (Resend → Nodemailer → Supabase → console)
- Certificate PDF: client-side via jsPDF + html2canvas-pro; Invoice PDF: client-side via jsPDF + jspdf-autotable
- Cashfree integration: subscriptions (create/cancel/resume/upgrade), payments, webhooks, refunds (local recording only)
- `RESEND_API_KEY` env var needed for student verification OTP emails
- `parseResumeFile` in `src/lib/file-parser.ts` is the central PDF/DOCX/TXT extraction module
- Vite `manualChunks` in `vite.config.ts` splits: xlsx, pdf, charts, supabase, editor, highlight, monaco, motion, icons, radix, forms, dates, markdown, dnd, validation, docs, overlays + catch-all "vendor"
- `adminContentAction` server function (POST) handles delete for `wcms_sections` and `events` tables via `supabaseAdmin` client (bypasses RLS)
- `LaunchOfferBanner.tsx` reads `promo-banner` from `wcms_sections`; hides if section not found or disabled; fallback defaults exist
- Removing `(supabaseAdmin as any)` from 6 files revealed real type bugs: missing columns, required fields, local type/DB type mismatches — all now fixed
- `as never` pattern used for dynamic objects on supabase .insert()/.update() across wcms + onboarding functions

